## Tabs

::: tabs
:::: tab [Composer]
```bash
composer require cakephp/cakephp:^5.2
```
::::

:::: tab [Rector]
```bash
bin/cake upgrade rector --rules cakephp50 src
```
::::

:::: tab [Tests]
```bash
vendor/bin/phpunit --filter ArticlesTable
```
::::
