## Code groups

::: code-group
```bash [Composer]
composer require cakephp/cakephp:^5.2
```

```json [composer.json]
{ "require": { "cakephp/cakephp": "^5.2" } }
```

```php [Application.php]
$this->addPlugin('Migrations');
```
:::

{.note}
:::
`--extension codeGroup`. One block per file, switched on screen and unfolded in the PDF.
:::

---

## Details, folded away

::: details
### The long version of why buffering changed

5.0 always buffered result sets, which raised memory on large exports. 5.1 brought back `disableBufferedResults()`.
:::

{.note}
:::
Useful for the question you only sometimes get asked.
:::

