---

## Spoilers and swatches

The answer to "how long does the upgrade take" is :spoiler[as long as your test suite is short].

Palette: :color[#d33c43] accent, :color[#1f7a4d] success, :color[#6b7280] muted.

---

## Code with callouts

```php
$query = $this->Articles->selectQuery();   <1>
$query->contain(['Authors'])               <2>
    ->where(['published' => true]);
```

<1> One query type, so the IDE and PHPStan know what comes next.
<2> Eager loading, which is the whole point of the slide.

{.note}
:::
`--extension codeCallouts`. The markers bind to the list under the block.
:::

